OL,3,AChildren and woman injured on
OL,4,Afairground ride
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo children and a woman have been
OL,7,Finjured while on a fairground ride in
OL,8,FSouth Yorkshire, police said.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to
OL,11,FMaltby Crags Fair in Rotherham on
OL,12,FFriday evening, which closed early
OL,13,Fafter the incident.
OL,15,FSouth Yorkshire Police said three
OL,16,Fpeople, aged 11, 13 and 21, had been
OL,17,Ftaken to hospital for treatment. The
OL,18,Fextent of their injuries is not yet
OL,19,Fclear.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/38
