OL,3,APassenger train derails in France
OL,4,Aleaving at least 44 injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 44 people have been injured,
OL,7,Fincluding one seriously, after a
OL,8,Fpassenger train derailed in northern
OL,9,FFrance, local officials have said.
OL,11,FAn 18-year-old woman was airlifted in
OL,12,Fcritical condition by helicopter to
OL,13,Fhospital.
OL,15,FTransport Minister Philippe Tabarot
OL,16,Fsaid 180 passengers were on board the
OL,17,Ftrain that was operating between Rouen
OL,18,Fand Caen in Normandy.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/38
